cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use EviTriage-QL in research, please cite the software using this
  metadata and record the exact release or commit used.
title: "EviTriage-QL: Evidence-Grounded LLM-Agent Triage for CodeQL Alerts"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "EviTriage-QL contributors"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: 2026-07-23
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A research software system for evidence-grounded, auditable secondary triage
  of CodeQL alerts. Version 0.2.0 retains the bounded offline vertical path and
  adds fail-closed environment, TPM2/systemd, and pass/GPG credential providers
  for the opt-in DeepSeek adapter; its labels are not an accuracy benchmark or
  authorization to dismiss upstream alerts.
keywords:
  - CodeQL
  - static analysis
  - vulnerability triage
  - software security
  - reproducible research
